+ * https://drive.google.com/file/d/15NLaUeMBy-iT8s6rFrP4Esf0Qh57T4xu/view?pli=1
+ *
+ * To figure out the addresses of SoC pads, look at table "Table 5-125. Pin Multiplexing" in the TDA4VM Processor datasheet
